>>
Rule 1 (valid real-valued domain for acos)
{v_1 : tensor} |= min(v_1) ≥ -1 ∧ max(v_1) ≤ 1
>>
Rule 2 (out tensor dtype must match input to avoid unsafe cast)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_2) = dtype_(v_1)
>>
Rule 3 (out tensor must have the same shape as input)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
>>
Rule 4 (supports tensors of any dimensionality)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 0
